{
  "_comment": "Repo-root settings for webinar-AI. Active for the parent session AND every subagent it spawns. Hard outer ring: subagents can run python3 and common shell tools, but cannot Read prior-cohort folders, substrate (webinar-meta), val data (F1), or other module folders. Inter-agent isolation within a single module (e.g. module-2/agent-06 reading module-2/agent-07) is NOT enforced here — settings.json cannot differentiate between subagents. Use prompt-level rules + post-run audit for that.",

